omx-plugins (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New plugins: omx keyed-gate, omx eq16 and omx eq32, as CLAP and LV2
    plugins.
  * Every LV2 plugin shows its controls with units, logarithmic frequency
    travel and named choices for the EQ band types and filter slopes.
  * New omx-plugins-dev package with the headers other projects include.
  * Builds against omx-dsp 0.1.8 and omx-contract 1.2.1.

 -- Pau Aliagas <linuxnow@gmail.com>  Thu, 08 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000

omx-plugins (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First package: the OpenMixer console's delay, drive, 8-band EQ and channel
    strip, each as a CLAP and an LV2 plugin, running the same DSP as the
    console (omx-dsp 0.1.4).

 -- Pau Aliagas <linuxnow@gmail.com>  Wed, 07 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
